cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use AMRScan, please cite this repository, the preprint below (version 2 of arXiv:2507.08062 describes AMRScan 2; version 1 of the same record described the 2025 toolkit) and the AMRFinderPlus software and database release you used. Version 2.1.0 also contains the code and result tables of the E. coli domain-shift study (manuscript submitted).
